
# seo
- label: the Microkeebs site exposes accurate canonical metadata, social previews, creator and website structured data, semantic page headings, and an AI-readable site summary without changing visible content or layout
  command: npm run build
  tags: [implemented]
- label: optimized Microkeebs gallery images use one _sm suffix so crawlers and browsers load the intended asset without a 404 fallback
  command: test -z "$(/usr/bin/find public/images -type f -name '*_sm_sm.webp' -print -quit)" && npm run build
  tags: [implemented]
